  "status": "Unsigned test build. User verified 0.2.17 on device; 0.2.18 compiled and host-checked, pending iPhone verification.",
  "changes": [
    "Only bridge dylib replaced. Unity engine, launcher, game assets, input binding JSON and touch library preserved.",
    "All 14 editable elements including back, gear/edit, more and optional FPS share one editor; title drag and collapse avoid covering keys.",
    "Five independent layout profiles approximately traced from user screenshots; normalized centre coordinates; full-width canvas with 8pt edge margin instead of an 84pt right-side strip.",
    "Secondary keys can be aligned horizontally or vertically; layout changes persist independently per posture. Old 0.2.17 preferences retained separately.",
    "Read-only GameState/UIState/inventory fields guide menu simplification; unknown state keeps controls visible. Half-fold retains all controls.",
    "Initial icon redraw and explicit foreground glyphs avoid waiting for first press; system UIGlassEffect with thin highlights and one-shot 18-layer particle gather, reduce-motion respected.",
    "Half-fold decorative background extends across software hinge gap, while button hit areas remain below hinge; physical crease is unaffected.",
    "GPU reflection uses reused 256px maximum-edge textures and one in-flight readback; UIImageView image swap avoids repeated ornament redraw.",
    "Balanced reflection target 20 FPS, smooth target 30 FPS, low power 12 and elevated thermal 10. Editor/background pause capture. Targets are not measured device results.",
    "HUD hierarchy search throttled from repeated per-tick scanning to changes or every 3 seconds; field metadata cached.",
    "Optional draggable submitted-frame FPS, resident-memory and reflection-latency monitor. No rolling frame image history."
  ],
  "inputPolicy": "Existing gameplay HID codes preserved; Skill/Tool exposed by default; Attack-confirm and dedicated Escape-back retained from 0.2.16. Internal action names are legacy names and are not automatically relabelled.",
  "verified": [
    "Strict arm64 iOS compilation with warnings treated as errors",
    "Clang static analyzer zero diagnostics",
    "70 full-width right-edge drag checks across 14 controls and 5 postures",
    "No default control rectangle overlaps among all 14 editable elements per profile, including optional FPS",
    "Five independent profile persistence; horizontal/vertical secondary alignment; menu/half-fold/editor visibility policies",
    "Verified source equality for render resolution synchronization, game-region geometry and gameplay joystick mapping apart from editor input suppression",
    "Return pulse visibility override precedes automatic menu filtering",
    "Native geometry preview rendered and inspected",
    "IPA integrity and exactly one replaced archive entry"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No iPhone runtime or GPU benchmark in this session; actual smoothness, memory use, menu detection and Liquid Glass appearance need device testing.",
    "FPS counts Unity command-buffer submissions, not guaranteed display presentation rate. Resident MB includes the entire app.",
    "Reflection is asynchronous and targets 20 or 30 FPS, not guaranteed one-to-one synchronization with every rendered game frame.",
    "Layouts are approximate defaults from screenshots; they are not an import of device preference data.",
    "Optional FPS overlay defaults off; drag it in the unified editor if it covers another element.",
    "No game camera, engine code or executable-header changes added in this update; physical camera/hinge occlusion cannot be painted over."
  ],
